          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bachitha bonke ababesemzini ngesiqalekiso, owesilisa nowesifazane, abasha nabadala, nezinkomo, nezimvu, nezimbongolo, ngosiko lwenkemba.",
          "type": "text",
