          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uJoshuwa wathi emadodeni amabili ayehlola ilizwe: Ngenani endlini yesifebe likhuphe lapho owesifazana lakho konke alakho, njengokufunga kwenu kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.22",
